{"seq":14,"trial_id":"matrix-mu-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/si-01-marrow-agrisupply-site/r4","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T08:03:41.597Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"a369a258b89d4dfdf46383eca8f74f7c64b0a59b81c368b1ad12c0e81c97d4ab","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#central-team","text":"@Priyanka \"Pree\" Sundaram it's Pine Crossing. On 9 Jun you posted here that the morning receiver at Pine Crossing said the appointment screen showed only the afternoon shift. A driver who arrived at 7:10 had his trailer number written on a sticky note. Hollis said he'd check the shift template and ask support to reproduce it with the store login. I didn't find a later update in this channel saying it was fixed, so you may want to check with him before you mark it resolved on the sheet.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791987000.000127","thread_ts":"1791987000.000126"}}
